{
	"ID": "20211226123130-jpeg5b2",
	"Spec": "2",
	"Type": "NodeDocument",
	"Properties": {
		"id": "20211226123130-jpeg5b2",
		"title": "書籤和標籤",
		"type": "doc",
		"updated": "20261116220110"
	},
	"Children": [
		{
			"ID": "20211226123145-atmx4pn",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20211226123145-atmx4pn",
				"updated": "20261024161440"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "書簽"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20211226123145-786ipku",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20211226123145-786ipku",
				"updated": "20260730184353"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "如果你需要“收藏”內容區塊，請通過區塊標菜單打開屬性面板，然後就可以在屬性面板中設置書簽了。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20211226123145-3rhy0b6",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20211226123145-3rhy0b6",
				"updated": "20261024161440"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "收藏的內容區塊會列在書籤面板中（"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Alt"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "+"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "3"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，macOS 為 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Control"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "+"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "3"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "）。取消收藏時，清空區塊的書籤屬性，或使用書籤面板中的刪除操作；這只移除書籤，不會刪除內容區塊。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20211226123145-fgyfo0x",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20211226123145-fgyfo0x",
				"updated": "20261116220110"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "標簽"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20211226123145-nxlldt1",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20211226123145-nxlldt1",
				"updated": "20260730184353"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "標簽用於在內容區塊中對該區塊進行標記。語法是通過一前一後兩個 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "#"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 將標簽標識包裹起來，像這樣 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "#標簽#"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20211226123145-fvftrvl",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20211226123145-fvftrvl",
				"updated": "20260730184353"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "標簽支援層級，這樣可以更方便地對內容區塊進行分類整理。不同層級之間使用 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "/"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 分隔，像這樣 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "#A/B/C#"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20211226123145-ucilhpd",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20211226123145-ucilhpd",
				"updated": "20260810212846"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "開啟標籤面板（"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "Alt"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​+"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "4"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " / "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "⌃"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "+"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "4"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​）。在桌面端點選標籤，會在全域搜尋中顯示相符的內容區塊。若要移除內容區塊上的標籤，直接在區塊中刪除該標籤即可。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261124191611-q7b8e3p",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261124191611-q7b8e3p",
				"updated": "20261124191611"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在行動裝置上，點選文件頁首的 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "新增標籤"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 開啟標籤選擇面板。候選清單中的勾選標記表示該標籤已新增到文件。新增完畢後，點選 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "關閉"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261118205131-60be77f",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261118205131-60be77f",
				"updated": "20261118205131"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在標籤面板中選擇 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "排序"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "自訂排序"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，即可直接拖曳標籤列調整同層順序。行動裝置請長按標籤列後拖曳。自訂順序隨工作空間資料儲存。從標籤面板刪除標籤後重新建立同名標籤，該標籤會排在已有排序位置的同層標籤之後。篩選標籤時，請先清除篩選條件再排序。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261118220329-b5e193c",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261118220329-b5e193c",
				"updated": "20261118220329"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在標籤面板中選擇 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "排序"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " - "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "最近新增"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，即可依標籤最近一次新增到文件或內容區塊的時間排列同層標籤。新增時間未知的標籤排在最後。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261116215152-20a2423",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261116215152-20a2423",
				"updated": "20261116220110"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在標籤面板選單中選擇 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "kbd",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "重命名"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，可跨文件統一修改該標籤及其子標籤。可在任一受影響文件中復原，並在該文件中重做；資料庫中已有的項目及其欄位值會保留。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20230928114735-uks4kf5",
			"Type": "NodeHeading",
			"HeadingLevel": 2,
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20230928114735-uks4kf5",
				"updated": "20230928114758"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "tag",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "注意"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20230928114731-0nurd8j",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20230928114731-0nurd8j",
				"updated": "20231205225753"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "請勿在書籤或標籤中使用特殊符號，否則會導致無法全域搜索，也無法在書籤/標籤面板中重新命名和刪除。 這裡的「特殊符號」包括："
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "*"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "_"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "["
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "]"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "!"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "\\"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "`"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "&lt;"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "&gt;"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "&amp;"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "~ "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "$"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "("
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": ")"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "{"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "}"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "="
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​ 和"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "#"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "​。"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
